sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Me
    participant P as codex session (gpt-5.6-sol)
    participant CS as codex security plugin (local)
    participant D as discovery reviewers
    participant S as sub-agents (3 each)
    participant R as dedup reducers
    participant GH as github
    Me->>P: "/goal scan all of our tools and open issues for the findings"
    P->>P: inventory repos, clone targets
    P->>CS: start deep scan (repo 1 of 22)
    par 4 reviewers at a time, rolling
        CS->>D: "run one standard scan"
        D->>S: spawn 3 sub-agents
        S-->>D: candidates
        D->>CS: record draft
    and
        CS->>R: merge + dedupe drafts
        R->>CS: merged findings
    end
    loop every ~30 s, for the whole scan
        P->>CS: still running? (re-reads ~185k tokens of context)
    end
    CS-->>P: stop rule met, sealed report
    P->>CS: complete scan
    P->>GH: one issue per finding
    P->>CS: start deep scan (next repo)
